# Emailing the minutes (ADR-33), for scripts/start_demo.sh. Copy to mail.env (gitignored by *.env) and fill locally.
# Never commit a real key. Without RESEND_API_KEY the post-meeting page says email is not set up, and nothing is sent.
# Nothing is ever sent automatically: only the "Send minutes by email" button on the post-meeting page sends.

# A Resend API key with sending access (https://resend.com/api-keys).
RESEND_API_KEY=
# The sender, on a domain verified with Resend. Either an address or "Name <address>".
CONVENE_MAIL_FROM="Convene <minutes@your-verified-domain.example>"
